<title>BRAZIL: Brazil tax receipts slip to 7.436 bln reais in Aug.</title>
<headline>Brazil tax receipts slip to 7.436 bln reais in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's federal tax receipts in August were 7.436 billion reais, said Lytha Spindola, deputy secretary of the Internal Revenue Service.</p>
<p>Spindola told reporters the August result was down 5.28 percent in real terms on July.</p>
<p>&quot;There are no big surprises, the August result was well within expectations,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom, 5561-223-0358</p>
